        "content": "{\"reviews\":[{\"review_id\":\"956ea79b-d153-45e2-a007-72bbfca92783\",\"review_text\":\"Better than iHeartRadio\"},{\"review_id\":\"506f6980-ddbf-483e-a12f-35e09a937803\",\"review_text\":\"Worst update everything premium I m very dissapointed I m unstalling this app😡\"},{\"review_id\":\"40cf0697-cdab-403c-91e8-8c0ecfca803e\",\"review_text\":\"I hate this app 👎👎🖐️🖐️🖐️\"},{\"review_id\":\"7955e61c-d3c3-4bb7-a04d-8cf055422b92\",\"review_text\":\"I love Spotify and have been a paid user for a long time. The app is beautifully built by some people who really know their stuff, it's fast and intuitive. Pay small artists more and you get 5 stars.\"},{\"review_id\":\"34e2ec9d-5a6f-4a68-a73b-1259cca7c3b8\",\"review_text\":\"🥰amazing\"},{\"review_id\":\"229839bc-9835-4657-aa10-016c279ecd46\",\"review_text\":\"After purchasing premium app is bevahe like mad...😡 please update it\"},{\"review_id\":\"cddd2bb8-dbf9-45dd-8932-63fec6827c1b\",\"review_text\":\"who tf is apple music\"},{\"review_id\":\"866d95b2-837f-443f-9c0b-14d47e94e4af\",\"review_text\":\"The update spoilt the whole app, fix it or no one's gonna listen through Spotify anymore 👎\"},{\"review_id\":\"10ab0276-d270-4574-9a88-8abef7e28e62\",\"review_text\":\"Ads were disturbing before, now only shuffle feature has ruined Spotify, UNINSTALLING 👍 do make an ad and let it on YouTube for a month, if you ever bring back old features., do make an ad on how your business📈📉., 🤣👎 thanks for testing my patience\"},{\"review_id\":\"76308a68-86de-4c9c-9d5d-106b5a0203ae\",\"review_text\":\"You have to buy every feature. It Was a good platform before but now It is THE WORST\"}]}"
